# Public build-time config only (rule R5): everything here ends up in the browser bundle.
# Origin of org-admin-api: scheme + host + optional port, no path (no /api/v1), no trailing credentials.
# Production: https://api.mmlabs.online. Empty = mock mode (screens use src/features/*/data/).
# Local real API through the Vite dev proxy: http://localhost:5173 (see README).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
# App key sent as X-MM-App and used as token audience (used from PAN-010).
VITE_APP_KEY=
# Cloudflare Turnstile site key (public) for the forgot-password page.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
